{"id":"u-7de5c56b-cf95-4fd7-9835-169511a817e6","src":"community","title":"Six Strong @ Home","author":"Eva MB","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/QPS2bF-at-home-db-5-day-split-2","desc":"A simple and progressive 6-week at-home strength and conditioning program using only dumbbells and resistance bands. The training follows a balanced 6-day split focused on building full-body strength, improving muscle definition, and increasing overall conditioning with clear weekly progression. Each session takes 35–55 minutes, and it’s recommended to include a 10-minute warm-up before and a 10-minute cool-down or stretch afterward. You should also add 3 days per week of additional abdominal and core training for 10–15 minutes on your own. When using heavier weights, rest 1 minute between sets; with lighter weights, rest 45 seconds between sets. Required equipment includes dumbbells, mini bands, and a long resistance band, with optional use of a pull-up bar, medicine ball, or yoga block. This program is suitable for intermediate trainees.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Athletics","Women's","Bodyweight Fitness"],"equipment":["Dumbbell Only"],"minutes":50,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-14T14:06:09.563Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Mon - Lower Body (No Cardio)","Thurs - Upper Body + Zone 3","Wed - Lower Body + Zone 2","Thurs - Upper Body (No Cardio)","Fri - Full Body + Conditioning","Sat - Lt Lower Body + Zone 2"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"B-Stance Romanian Deadlift (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":6}]},{"n":"Single Leg Romanian Deadlift","sets":[{"r":12,"x":6}]},{"n":"Hip Thrust (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Single Leg Hip Thrust","sets":[{"r":12,"x":6}]},{"n":"Glute Bridge (Dumbbell & Feet Elevated)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Combo: Single Leg RDL To Hinging Reverse Lunge","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Frog Pump","sets":[{"r":30,"x":2}]},{"n":"Walk","sets":[{"sec":36